				<div id=3D"mw-content-text" class=3D"mw-body-content"><div class=3D"mw-=
content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang=3D"en" dir=3D"ltr"><figure class=3D"mw-h=
align-right" typeof=3D"mw:File/Thumb"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/wik=
