<p>All NES units come with at least one standard controller - without it, y=
ou wouldn't be able to play any games!
</p><p>Standard controllers can be used in both controller ports, or in a <=
a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/wiki/Four_score" class=3D"mw-redirect" tit=
le=3D"Four score">Four score</a> accessory.
</p>
<dl><dd><i>For code examples, see: <a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/wiki/C=
ontroller_reading_code" title=3D"Controller reading code">Controller readin=
g code</a></i></dd></dl>
